  "body": "Whether you're stepping onto the property ladder or adding to your portfolio, this is a smart, future-focused opportunity in a sought-after Whangaparaoa location.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted at $680 per week, the home provides immediate income from day one - making it ideal for first-home buyers wanting to secure now and move in later, or investors looking for a solid, low-maintenance addition with approximately 4.8% gross yield.\r\n\r\nCleverly designed across three levels, the home offers space, comfort, and flexibility. The light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows seamlessly to a sunny deck overlooking a peaceful greenbelt - perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features two generous double bedrooms with great storage, serviced by a central bathroom, while downstairs adds real versatility with a large multi-purpose space, its own bathroom, and separate access - ideal for extended family, working from home, or enhancing rental appeal.\r\n\r\nSet in a super convenient location, you can leave the car at home. Walk to Whangaparaoa School, shops, supermarket, gym, library, and transport, with beautiful beaches like Arkles Bay, Stanmore Bay, and Little Manly just minutes away.\r\n\r\nBuy now, benefit from rental income, and secure your place for the future.\r\n\r\nTo view/download the property files please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/QR3C",
